%% Figure 3. Dynamic view SD-1: a job seeker applies (FR-07, QAS-3)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Job Seeker
  participant W as Web App (Draft Store, API Client)
  participant F as Firebase Authentication
  participant G as Tamkeen API: Rate Limiter, Auth Guard, Access Policy
  participant I as Idempotency Filter
  participant A as Applications Module
  participant P as Profiles Module
  participant D as Main Database
  participant B as Event Bus
  Note over S,B: Legend: solid arrow = request or call, dashed arrow = reply, Note = component behaviour
  S->>W: Presses "Send application" (chose which work needs to share)
  W->>W: Draft Store saves the form + Idempotency-Key K (UUID)
  W->>F: getIdToken()
  F-->>W: ID token (short-lived)
  W->>G: POST /v1/applications, Bearer token, Idempotency-Key: K
  G->>G: verify token, role = job_seeker, rate limit ok
  G->>I: forward request
  I->>D: reserve key K (unique index)
  D-->>I: new key
  I->>A: submit(jobId, sharedNeeds)
  A->>P: getSharedNeeds(uid, selected ids)
  P-->>A: work needs only (never disability status)
  A->>D: transaction: insert application + outbox event application.submitted
  D-->>A: committed
  A->>B: publish application.submitted
  A-->>I: 201 Created, application summary
  I->>D: store response for K (24 h)
  I-->>W: 201 Created
  W->>W: Draft Store clears K
  W-->>S: aria-live: "Application sent"
